{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30167","headline":"莺出谷 · 钱可复","name":"莺出谷","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉律阳和变，时禽羽翮新。\n载飞初出谷，一啭已惊人。\n拂柳宜烟暖，冲花觉露春。\n抟风翻翰疾，向日弄吭频。\n求友心何切，迁乔幸有因。\n华林高玉树，栖托及芳晨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱可复","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30167.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30167","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}